[00:00.78] (Carl Smith)
[00:11.70] That nifty spot inside my heart
[00:14.74] For someone just like you
[00:17.20] Been saving all my hugs and kisses
[00:20.04] And hope you saved some too.
[00:22.82] So pack your lovin' and your little old bag
[00:25.88] And move on in today
[00:28.18] 'Cause you got all the loving that I'll ever need
[00:31.36] So move on in and stay.
[00:34.22] Move on in, stay a long, long time
[00:36.92] And don't ever go away
[00:39.42] 'Cause I want you near forever dear
[00:42.44] So move on in and stay.
